ow and every tongue swear. Before Thee, O Lord our God, will they kneel and fall and to the glory of Thy Name will they grant honour and they will all accept the yoke of Thy Kingdom. And Thou shalt soon reign over them for ever and ever. For Thine is the Kingdom and for all eternity shalt Thou reign in glory."}], "paragraph": 1}]}, "review_encoding": true, "stem": "musaf_repetition_al_ken", "title": {"en": "Therefore we hope", "he": "על כן נקוה"}, "urn": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/repetition/al_ken", "wording_selection": [{"features": {"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/al_ken/text/en/quiet_printing": false, "urn:x-opensiddur:condition:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/al_ken/text/en/repetition_printing": true, "urn:x-opensiddur:condition:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/al_ken/text/he/quiet_printing": false, "urn:x-opensiddur:condition:siddur:rosh_hashanah/musaf/al_ken/text/he/repetition_printing": true}, "type": "opensiddur:variant"}]}, "variants": []}
